CowSwapModuleFactory_Create
├── when owner is zero address
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_ZeroOwner
├── when paymentRails is zero address
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_ZeroPaymentRails
└── when params are valid
    ├── it should deploy a new CowSwapModule contract
    ├── it should set the owner on the deployed module
    ├── it should wire the module to the PaymentRails
    ├── it should wire the module to the factory chain config
    ├── it should register the module in the factory
    ├── it should increment the module count
    ├── it should register the module under the PaymentRails lookup
    ├── it should emit a CowSwapModuleCreated event
    └── when called multiple times
        ├── it should deploy distinct instances
        ├── it should register all instances
        └── it should accumulate instances in the PaymentRails lookup
